<span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3862">1:04:22</a> 从未预想过的结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4444">1:14:04</a> 山海与古天神的注视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5072">1:24:32</a> </span><strong><span>杨婵：杨婵何罪之有 我绝不认罪！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5106">1:25:06</a> 杨婵的自我认同：勇敢坚定的选择与有限的主体性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5950">1:39:10</a> 刘彦昌和杨婵形象的成立共同承托起《背叛》的发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6976">1:56:16</a> 关于《思凡》的讨论：存在本身即是意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期节目中提到的相关资料与作品】</span></p><span></span><p><span>德语音乐剧《伊丽莎白》（Elisabeth）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《三梦记》 （出自音乐剧《梦微之》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐剧《赵氏孤儿》</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧《伦敦生活》（Fleabag）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于放言低论】</span></p><span></span><p><span>放言低论，改编自成语“放言高论”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本栏目由两名爱看戏剧的女性观众主持，旨在对戏剧及更多生活中的种种进行简单探讨。希望创造一个能够畅所欲言的空间，自由地表达和分享。</span></p>]]></description>
